    "timeline": {
      "type": "timeline",
      "blocks": {
        "item-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "2013",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "A story of shared vision",
            "heading_style": "h2",
            "content": "<p>This project began with two creative minds, united by both passion and purpose. From day one, the goal was clear: to build something meaningful together. What started as a simple idea turned into a first product launch—and the beginning of a lasting journey.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "link",
            "mobile_text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "item-2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "2014",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "No middlemen",
            "heading_style": "h2",
            "content": "<p>By working directly with you, we eliminate unnecessary markups and focus on what matters: offering thoughtfully designed, high-quality pieces at a fair price. A modern approach to fashion, rooted in transparency.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "link",
            "mobile_text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "item-3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "2015",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Crafted in Italy",
            "heading_style": "h2",
            "content": "<p>Production takes place in a family-run workshop near Naples, known for its artisanal expertise. The collaboration is close and ongoing, with daily conversations shaping both the process and the products. More than just a manufacturer—true partners in craft.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "link",
            "mobile_text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "item-4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "2017",
            "subheading": "Subheading",
            "title": "Discover our products",
            "heading_style": "h2",
            "content": "<p>Located in the heart of the city, our showroom is open throughout the week and offers the ideal place to explore the full range in person.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "link",
            "mobile_text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "item-1",
        "item-2",
        "item-3",
        "item-4"
      ],
